{"chapters":[{"title":"Direct-address array","code":"class MyHashMap:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.slots = [-1] * (10 ** 6 + 1)\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        self.slots[key] = value\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        return self.slots[key]\n\n    def remove(self, key):\n        self.slots[key] = -1","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Direct-address array</strong> &mdash; O(1) per operation time, O(key range) extra space. Running <code>m = MyHashMap(); m.put(1, 10); m.put(10008, 20); m.put(1, 30) …</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self","label":"self","v":["M","y","H","a","s","h","M","a","p"],"cls":["","","","","","","","",""]}],"vars":[["self","'MyHashMap'",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.slots = [-1] * (10 ** 6 + 1)</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.slots = [-1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]</code>","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.slots[key] = value</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.slots[1]</code> becomes <code>10</code>; <code>key = 1</code>; <code>value = 10</code>","line":6,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 10, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",1],["key","1",1],["value","10",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.slots[key] = value</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>key = 10008</code>; <code>value = 20</code>","line":6,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 10, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",0],["key","10008",1],["value","20",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.slots[key] = value</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.slots[1]</code> becomes <code>30</code>; <code>key = 1</code>; <code>value = 30</code>","line":6,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 30, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",1],["key","1",1],["value","30",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return self.slots[key]</code> &mdash; returns <code>30</code>","line":9,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 30, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",0],["key","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return self.slots[key]</code> &mdash; returns <code>20</code>; <code>key = 10008</code>","line":9,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 30, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",0],["key","10008",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return self.slots[key]</code> &mdash; returns <code>-1</code>; <code>key = 5</code>","line":9,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, 30, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",0],["key","5",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.slots[key] = -1</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.slots[1]</code> becomes <code>-1</code>; <code>key = 1</code>","line":12,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",1],["key","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return self.slots[key]</code> &mdash; returns <code>-1</code>. <strong>Result: -1</strong>","line":9,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.slots","[-1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, -1, …]",0],["key","1",0]],"stack":[]}],"example":1},{"title":"Separate chaining with (key, value) pairs","code":"class MyHashMap:\n    B = 10007\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.buckets = [[] for _ in range(self.B)]\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]\n        for pair in bucket:\n            if pair[0] == key:\n                pair[1] = value                 # update, do not duplicate\n                return\n        bucket.append([key, value])\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        for k, v in self.buckets[key % self.B]:\n            if k == key:\n                return v\n        return -1\n\n    def remove(self, key):\n        bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]\n        for i, (k, _) in enumerate(bucket):\n            if k == key:\n                bucket.pop(i)\n                return","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Separate chaining with (key, value) pairs</strong> &mdash; O(1) average time, O(buckets + n) extra space. Running <code>m.put(1, 1); m.put(2, 2); assert m.get(1) == 1 and m.get(3) == -1; m.put(2, 1); assert m.get(2) == 1 …</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":7,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]</code> &mdash; <code>bucket = []</code>","line":8,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for pair in bucket:</code>","line":9,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket.append([key, value])</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.buckets[1]</code> becomes <code>[[1, 1]]</code>; <code>bucket</code> gets <code>[1, 1]</code> appended","line":13,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["1,1"],"cls":["cur"]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",1],["key","1",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]</code> &mdash; <code>key = 2</code>; <code>value = 2</code>; <code>[1, 1]</code> popped off the end of <code>bucket</code>","line":8,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",1],["value","2",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for pair in bucket:</code>","line":9,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["value","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket.append([key, value])</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.buckets[2]</code> becomes <code>[[2, 2]]</code>; <code>bucket</code> gets <code>[2, 2]</code> appended","line":13,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,2"],"cls":["cur"]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",1],["key","2",0],["value","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for k, v in self.buckets[key % self.B]:</code> &mdash; <code>key = 1</code>; <code>k = 1</code>; <code>v = 1</code>","line":16,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",1],["k","1",1],["v","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if k == key:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (k = 1, key = 1)","line":17,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",0],["k","1",0],["v","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return v</code> &mdash; returns <code>1</code>","line":18,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","1",0],["k","1",0],["v","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for k, v in self.buckets[key % self.B]:</code> &mdash; <code>key = 3</code>","line":16,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","3",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return -1</code> &mdash; returns <code>-1</code>","line":19,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","3",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]</code> &mdash; <code>key = 2</code>; <code>value = 1</code>; <code>bucket = [[2, 2]]</code>","line":8,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,2"],"cls":[""]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",1],["value","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for pair in bucket:</code> &mdash; <code>pair = [2, 2]</code>","line":9,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"arr","id":"pair","label":"pair","v":["2","2"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if pair[0] == key:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (key = 2)","line":10,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"arr","id":"pair","label":"pair","v":["2","2"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 2]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>pair[1] = value</code> &mdash; <code>self.buckets[2][0]</code> becomes <code>[2, 1]</code>; <code>bucket[0][1]</code> becomes <code>1</code>; <code>pair[1]</code> becomes <code>1</code> <em>(update, do not duplicate)</em>","line":11,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,1"],"cls":["cur"]},{"t":"arr","id":"pair","label":"pair","v":["2","1"],"cls":["","cur"]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",1],["key","2",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>","line":12,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,1"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"arr","id":"pair","label":"pair","v":["2","1"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["value","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for k, v in self.buckets[key % self.B]:</code> &mdash; <code>k = 2</code>; <code>v = 1</code>","line":16,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["k","2",1],["v","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if k == key:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (k = 2, key = 2)","line":17,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["k","2",0],["v","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return v</code> &mdash; returns <code>1</code>","line":18,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["k","2",0],["v","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket = self.buckets[key % self.B]</code> &mdash; <code>bucket = [[2, 1]]</code>","line":22,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,1"],"cls":[""]}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for i, (k, _) in enumerate(bucket):</code> &mdash; <code>i = 0</code>; <code>k = 2</code>; <code>_ = 1</code>","line":23,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,1"],"cls":["src"],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["i","0",1],["k","2",1],["_","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if k == key:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (k = 2, key = 2)","line":24,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":["2,1"],"cls":["src"],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [[2, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["i","0",0],["k","2",0],["_","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>bucket.pop(i)</code> &mdash; <code>self.buckets[2]</code> becomes <code>[]</code>; <code>[2, 1]</code> popped off the end of <code>bucket</code>","line":25,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",1],["key","2",0],["i","0",0],["k","2",0],["_","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>","line":26,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"bucket","label":"bucket","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0],["i","0",0],["k","2",0],["_","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for k, v in self.buckets[key % self.B]:</code>","line":16,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.buckets","[[], [[1, 1]], [], [], [], [], [], [], …]",0],["key","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return -1</code> &mdash; returns <code>-1</